  "raw_text": "A planned addition to the wrapup workflow was identified: a deploy step that reads git diff --name-only against sys_adm to find recently changed files and copies only those to ~/bin, rather than syncing the entire directory. The sys_adm repo is the authoritative source for shell scripts and the ~/bin directory is the deployed runtime location, but there is currently no automated mechanism connecting them. Wiring this into /wrapup as the final step before session close would close the gap between editing a script and having it available as a command, and would do so selectively based on what was actually worked on in the session rather than blindly overwriting everything.",
